<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>University Approval Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .logo span {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .black {
            color: black;
        }
        .purple {
            color: #6b46c1;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .status {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #e8f5e9;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: block;
            width: 200px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #6b46c1;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #5a3aa9;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- EduVerse Logo -->
        <div class="logo">
            <span class="black">E</span><span class="purple">duverse</span>
        </div>

        <div class="header">University Approval Notification</div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear <strong><%= universityName %></strong>,</p>

            <p>We are pleased to inform you that your **university registration** with <strong>EduVerse</strong> has been **approved**.</p>

            <div class="status">
                Approval Status: <strong>Approved</strong>
            </div>

            <p><strong>Registered Details:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>University Name:</strong> <%= universityName %></li>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> <%= email %></li>
                <li><strong>Contact Number:</strong> <%= contactNumber %></li>
                <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="<%= website %>" target="_blank"><%= website %></a></li>
            </ul>

            <p>You can now log in to your dashboard and start managing courses, faculty, and students.</p>

            <a href="<%= dashboardLink %>" class="cta-button">Go to Dashboard</a>

            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>

            <p>Welcome to <strong>EduVerse</strong>, where education meets innovation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> EduVerse. All rights reserved.
            <br>
            Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@eduverse.com" style="color: #6b46c1;">support@eduverse.com</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
